ISMS Builder — Czech context fork
=================================

This repository (https://github.com/netcraftsolutions/isms-builder) is a fork
of the upstream ISMS Builder project, maintained for adaptation to the Czech
regulatory environment (zákon č. 264/2025 Sb. o kybernetické bezpečnosti and
the implementing NÚKIB decree on cybersecurity measures).

